{"id":"e8d93d31f2068246","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula.md","title":"Relativized Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta 0^{0,A}$","display":"df-delta-0-oracle-formula — Relativized Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta_0^{0,A}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula","aliases":["58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula"],"display":"df-delta-0-oracle-formula — Relativized Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta_0^{0,A}$","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-0-oracle-formula — Relativized Bounded Quantifier Formulas <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"732c8884db2d0c67\" href=\"?note=732c8884db2d0c67\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md\">../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md\">../batch08/58-df-oracle.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Oracle}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Oracle}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md\">../batch08/58-df-oracle.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}^{(-)}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}^{(-)}_S,\\Delta_0^{0,(-)}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}^{(-)}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}^{(-)}_S,\\Delta_0^{0,(-)}:V^2\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\{\\langle A,t\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq V\\mid \\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq F\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\mid \\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq D\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;((\\forall x&lt;t\\;\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\exists x&lt;t\\;\\varphi)\\in D)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\{\\langle A,t\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq V\\mid \\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq F\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma) &amp;\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\mid \\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq D\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;((\\forall x&lt;t\\;\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\exists x&lt;t\\;\\varphi)\\in D)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\)</span> 公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\)</span> 公式相同，但允许原子谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(t)\">\\(A(t)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(t)\">\\(A(t)\\)</span> 是 Oracle 谓词，检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是否属于 Oracle 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>相对化算术层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{0,A}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^{0,A}\">\\(\\Pi_n^{0,A}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^{0,A}\">\\(\\Delta_n^{0,A}\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\)</span> 为基础层级</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A = \\emptyset\">\\(A = \\emptyset\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A} = \\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A} = \\Delta_0^0\\)</span></li>\n<li>带自由变元元组的片段可记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\vec{x})=\\{\\varphi(\\vec{x})\\in\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\mid \\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{\\vec{x}\\}\\}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\vec{x})=\\{\\varphi(\\vec{x})\\in\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\mid \\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{\\vec{x}\\}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(t)\">\\(A(t)\\)</span> abbreviates the oracle atomic formula corresponding to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\check A\">\\(t\\in\\check A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>58-df-delta-0-formula — 绝对有界量词公式集</li>\n<li>58-df-atomic-formula — 原子公式</li>\n<li>58-df-oracle — Oracle</li>\n<li>58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy — 相对化算术层级</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"732c8884db2d0c67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Oracle}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Oracle}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}^{(-)}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}^{(-)}_S,\\Delta_0^{0,(-)}:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &\\coloneqq \\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\{\\langle A,t\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma) &\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq V\\mid \\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq F\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma) &\\coloneqq \\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\mid \\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^{A}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq D\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;((\\forall x<t\\;\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\exists x<t\\;\\varphi)\\in D)\\}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^0","display":false},{"tex":"A(t)","display":false},{"tex":"A(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"A = \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A} = \\Delta_0^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\vec{x})=\\{\\varphi(\\vec{x})\\in\\Delta_0^{0,A}\\mid \\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{\\vec{x}\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\check A","display":false}],"bytes":2540,"backlinks":[{"id":"72859a2d81ce2e93","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)$ and $\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)$ (oracle-language formula codes and bounded fragment, see [[58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula.md|58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["732c8884db2d0c67","65418b505fc53093","0724d9f2bd401655"]}